        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Return Rate by Month</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Return rates show clear seasonality, peaking in August with sustained highs in September and December. With lower rates in mid-year and November, it is evident that purchasing cycles and promotions significantly influence return behavior.  </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
