        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>The analysis reveals that return rates are driven by a combination of product category and seasonality. Technology products show the highest return rates, particularly in late summer and early fall, while Office Supplies also experience a spike in August. Furniture displays more moderate return patterns across months.</run>
